        "SSML": "<speak>\nYou have reached the Securities and Exchange Commission Service Desk.\n\n<break time=\"400ms\"/>\n\nIf you are experiencing a telework-related issue, press one.\n\n<break time=\"250ms\"/>\n\nTo report a computer or telephone problem, request a service, or reset your password, press two.\n\n<break time=\"250ms\"/>\n\nIf you need audio, video, or other technical assistance in a conference room, press three.\n\n<break time=\"250ms\"/>\n\nIf your computer is working properly, but you need how to assistance with applications such as Word, Excel, or PowerPoint, press four.\n\n<break time=\"250ms\"/>\n\nIf you need assistance using the Municipal Advisor Registration Form, press five.\n\n<break time=\"250ms\"/>\n\nFor assistance with the Delphi Prism financial system, press six.\n\n<break time=\"350ms\"/>\n\nYou can also report a computer problem or request a service by browsing to\n<say-as interpret-as=\"characters\">OIT</say-as>\nHelp.\n\n<break time=\"350ms\"/>\n\nTo repeat these menu options, press nine.\n</speak>"
      },
